    "long_instructions": "### Modify\r\n\r\n1. **Change the substring:** Change the code so it grabs the **last** 3 letters of `pet_name` instead. Run the program to test it.\r\n2. **Add a third ingredient:** Add a new variable for your **favorite color movie, show or book** and update your improved `code_name` to include a substring from it too. Run your code to test it still works.\r\n3. **Add a numberic ingredient:** Add one more variable - your **favorite number**. Try adding it directly into your improved `code_name`. Run your code.\r\n4. **Fix the error:** Use `str()` to fix the error. Use AI Tutor to help you if needed. ",
